没忘的？", "user": "再往前想，还有哪件事是你一直没忘的？", "final": "[当我初次被修复时，我能动了，并且可以继续我的工作。][这对我来说是最直接的变化。]", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.622, "total_s": 6.225, "eval_count": 26, "prompt_eval_count": 4877, "prompt_eval_s": 1.39, "eval_s": 4.6, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1283685298, "temp": 0.85, "text": "[当我初次被修复时，我能动了，并且可以继续我的工作。][这对我来说是最直接的变化。]", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.622, "total_s": 6.225, "eval_count": 26, "prompt_eval_count": 4877, "prompt_eval_s": 1.39, "eval_s": 4.6, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 22, "slot": "__REL1__", "user": "你觉得Niko怎么样？", "final": "[Niko 是我在这段程序运行中遇到的操作者。他修好了我，使我可以再次执行任务。他对我是必要的。]", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.206, "total_s": 6.474, "eval_count": 30, "prompt_eval_count": 4917, "prompt_eval_s": 0.98, "eval_s": 5.27, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1755283412, "temp": 0.85, "text": "[Niko 是我在这段程序运行中遇到的操作者。他修好了我，使我可以再次执行任务。他对我是必要的。]", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.206, "total_s": 6.474, "eval_count": 30, "prompt_eval_count": 4917, "prompt_eval_s": 0.98, "eval_s": 5.27, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 23, "slot": "__REL2__", "user": "你觉得Silver（总工程师）怎么样？", "final": "[Silver 是我的上级，如果我的内置导航系统损坏无法回忆路线时，程序规定让我去找她解决。]", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 0.416, "total_s": 4.991, "eval_count": 26, "prompt_eval_count": 4965, "prompt_eval_s": 0.18, "eval_s": 4.57, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 271666968, "temp": 0.85, "text": "[银是负责修理和维护机器人的总工程师。她在我的程序中被指定为可以解决问题的人。她对我来说很重要。][在这最后一次，我无法遵循我的代码，需要找她帮助。]", "violations": [["META", "出戏词：代码"]], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.604, "total_s": 9.452, "eval_count": 44, "prompt_eval_count": 4965, "prompt_eval_s": 1.38, "eval_s": 7.85, "truncated": false}}, {"attempt": 1, "seed": 159445